## 5. Domain Events

### What are Domain Events?

**Domain Events** represent something important that happened in the domain.

**Purpose**:
- Decouple components
- Enable event-driven architecture
- Support event sourcing
- Audit trail

### MaritimeIQ Domain Events

```csharp
public class VesselPositionUpdatedEvent
{
    public int VesselId { get; }
    public Position NewPosition { get; }
    public DateTime Timestamp { get; }
    
    public VesselPositionUpdatedEvent(int vesselId, Position newPosition)
    {
        VesselId = vesselId;
        NewPosition = newPosition;
        Timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow;
    }
}

// Raise event
public void UpdatePosition(Position position)
{
    CurrentPosition = position;
    RaiseDomainEvent(new VesselPositionUpdatedEvent(Id, position));
}
```

